            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.8.1+MAT.8.2+MAT.8.3+MAT.8.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 8:1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.1.40+MRK.1.41+MRK.1.42+MRK.1.43+MRK.1.44+MRK.1.45"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 1:40-45",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naakali kumunzi umwi, muntu uwakali ecinsenda mubili woonse naakabona Jesu, wakavundama wamukumbilisya kuti, O mwami, na wayanda ulakonzya kundisalazya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatambika ijanza lyakwe, wamujata wati, Ndayanda, usalale, Mpoonya awo cinsenda cakamana kulinguwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.14.1+LEV.14.2+LEV.14.3+LEV.14.4+LEV.14.5+LEV.14.6+LEV.14.7+LEV.14.8+LEV.14.9+LEV.14.10+LEV.14.11+LEV.14.12+LEV.14.13+LEV.14.14+LEV.14.15+LEV.14.16+LEV.14.17+LEV.14.18+LEV.14.19+LEV.14.20+LEV.14.21+LEV.14.22+LEV.14.23+LEV.14.24+LEV.14.25+LEV.14.26+LEV.14.27+LEV.14.28+LEV.14.29+LEV.14.30+LEV.14.31+LEV.14.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 14:1-32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.13.49"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13:49",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo wakamulailila kuti, Utaambili muntu, Pele koya ukalibonye kumupaizi, ukapede kukusalazigwa kwako mbuli mulao wa-Musa, cibe citondezyo kulimbabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwalo impuwo yakwe yakaindilila kukomena, makamu makamu aabantu akayoboloka kumuswiilila akuponyegwa kuzilwazi zyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.1.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 1:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anukuti wakazwa walo, wainka musokwe kuyookomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
