              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.9.1+MAT.9.2+MAT.9.3+MAT.9.4+MAT.9.5+MAT.9.6+MAT.9.7+MAT.9.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 9:1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.2.1+MRK.2.2+MRK.2.3+MRK.2.4+MRK.2.5+MRK.2.6+MRK.2.7+MRK.2.8+MRK.2.9+MRK.2.10+MRK.2.11+MRK.2.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 2:1-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bumwi buzuba wakali kwiisya, eno bakalikede awo ba-Farisi abaiyi bamilao, abakazwa kuminzi yoonse yaku-Galilaya aku-Judaya aku-Jerusalemu, nkabela inguzu zya-Jehova wakali azyo kubaponya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela baalumi, abatembekede muntu abulo, uuyuminide mubili, bakayanda kumunjizya akumubika kubusyu bwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele mbobatakajene mpobamunjizizya nkaambo kabantu banjibanji, bakatanta aciluli, bagwisya zidina, balengelezya bulo mbwaakalede uuyuminide mubili, bamuselusizya kumbele lya-Jesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walo naakabona lusyomo lwabo wakati, Mwaalumi, wajatilwa zibi zyako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
