              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.2.18+MRK.2.19+MRK.2.20+MRK.2.21+MRK.2.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 2:18-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bati kulinguwe, Nkaambonzi basikwiiya ba-Johane balaliimya kulya lyoonse, balakomba lyoonse, abalo baba-Farisi mbubonya, pele abako balalya, balanywa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wabavuwa kuti, Sena mulakonzya kwiimya beenzinyina sikukwata kulya nacili abo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwalo alasika mazuba, awo sikukwata azwa kulimbabo, bayooliimya ayo mazuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo wakabaambila cikozyano kuti, Taakwe muntu uubbatika cibbati cipya kungubo nkulukulu, nkaambo icipya cilazapula cikulukulu, icibbati cipya taciswaangani ecisani cikulukulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi taakwe muntu uutila waini mupya munkomo nkulukulu, nkaambo waini mupya ulakwamuna nkomo, walo waini ulatika, enkomo zilafwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele waini mupya watilwa munkomo impya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 5:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taakwe muntu uunga na wanywa waini mukulukulu mpoonya mpoonya ayande mupya, nkaambo wati, Mukulukulu ngomubotu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.5.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.5.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
